[{"id":166943114,"discussion_id":"bec7413c7b00f27159df120be9844d3968b66fbf","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| attention | ✅ [*haijie_699874*](https://gitcode.com/haijie_699874), [*tang-hao-hw-gitcode*](https://gitcode.com/tang-hao-hw-gitcode) (2/2) | ✅ [*haijie_699874*](https://gitcode.com/haijie_699874), [*tang-hao-hw-gitcode*](https://gitcode.com/tang-hao-hw-gitcode) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n huang-chuhong, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-31T11:18:56+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-31T21:40:50+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166943129,"discussion_id":"b05268936647215350add9a03269a3f5bf9e5a10","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-31T11:19:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-31T11:19:00+08:00","user":{"id":"68771b9430980b376fba17a0","login":"huang-chuhong","object_id":"68771b9430980b376fba17a0","name":"huang-chuhong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/huang-chuhong"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166943140,"discussion_id":"d17577df2439ab459210c69aeea4028f7307d939","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-31T11:19:03+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-31T11:19:03+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166943224,"discussion_id":"704fc4ddf51cfa0040c65808658c353223883d40","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复矩阵乘法（Matmul）内核函数中，沿M轴切分计算循环次数时的变量名拼写错误。该错误导致在计算M轴循环次数时，错误地使用了`baseN`作为除数，而非正确的`baseM`，可能引发循环次数计算错误，进而影响矩阵乘法的正确执行。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n将函数 `MatmulKM` 中计算 M 轴循环次数的表达式 `(param.singleM + baseM - 1) / baseN` 修正为 `(param.singleM + baseM - 1) / baseM`。此修改确保了当矩阵的 M 维度大于基础块大小时，能正确计算出需要迭代的循环次数，从而正确处理矩阵分块计算。","created_at":"2026-03-31T11:19:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-31T11:19:29+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166943369,"discussion_id":"4b0bc996d0ac3df7e236c1757f0e91b2f56ddcf5","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=fa6792233a374f338b8533070898b612&projectName=CANN'>fa6792233a374f338b8533070898b612</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table styl